+`/eduel <SimName>` searches living nearby `SimPlayer` objects only. Remote COOP humans remain excluded. Ordinary NPCs are not challenge targets unless the runtime object is genuinely represented by `SimPlayer`.
+
+`/eduel selftest` runs the deterministic willingness-policy checks that do not require live Erenshor actors.
