+## Optional Deep Sims bridge
+
+Practice Duels has no hard dependency on Deep Sims. When `ErenshorDeepSims.DeepSimsPlugin.NotifyObservedGameEvent` is available at runtime, Practice Duels exposes verified lifecycle events:
+
+```text
+duel_challenge
+duel_accepted
+duel_declined
+duel_started
+duel_completed
+duel_cancelled
+```
+
+Declines include the authoritative game-side decision token in the event description. `duel_completed` includes the verified winner/loser when there is one. Non-outcome lifecycle events use a zero base chatter chance so this bridge does not create a stream of spectator dialogue; the completed duel remains the meaningful social observation.
+
+The LLM never decides whether a duel starts.
 
